<!--
  The "Kornerstones" section header icon on the Korner detail screen.

  Ported from the iOS asset
  `kornerz/Kornerz/Resources/Assets.xcassets/Home/kornerstones.imageset/
  kornerstones.svg`, used by iOS `KornerUsersView.swift:30-32` via
  `TabHeaderView(image: .init("kornerstones"), ...)`.

  The SVG's `viewBox` is `0 0 26 29` — narrower and taller than the
  36x36 section icons — so the artwork is carried over verbatim into a
  matching viewport. The filled `#EBE1D3` (Sand) hexagon badge and the
  `#2E2F3E` (Charcoal) stroked stone/arc glyph are unchanged; the SVG's
  `stroke-miterlimit="10"` becomes `android:strokeLineJoin="miter"` and
  the default `stroke-width` of 1 user unit stays 1.
-->
